dentials. Authentication is disabled when the supplied password is empty.\n\nAll five packages run the same `set_get`, `pipeline`, and `error` workloads against Redis 8.2.1, with identical keys and plain-string values in database zero. Pipelines submit two `SET` commands before waiting, then read back both values. Error scenarios write a string and verify that `LPUSH` fails with `WRONGTYPE`. Rediscala also has a separate `MULTI`/`EXEC` transaction scenario.\n\nContracts classify spans as `db.redis.client` and retain client-specific span shapes and startup commands. Redis needs no initialization beyond its readiness check; PostgreSQL and MariaDB apply their packaged SQL schemas.\n\n### Known instrumentation gaps\n\nJedis does not mark rejected `LPUSH` spans as errors. Rediscala does not emit `db.query.text`.","title":"Add Java Redis client conformance"},"mode":"publish","pr":137,"protocol":"git-candidate-v1","publication":{"auth_mode":"fine_grained_pat","authorized_actor_id":218610,"authorized_at":1792376994,"generation":4,"max_pipelines":5,"phase":"f75ff74aa1324a17bbc074bc9a7c8423","profile":"git-candidate-v1","required_checks":["Analyze (actions)","CodeQL","Coverage model","Discover scenarios","EasyCLA","Lint","Relock (${{ matrix.ecosystem }})","Scenarios (database-java)","Scenarios (gen-ai-python)","Scenarios (http-dotnet)","Scenarios (http-go)","Scenarios (http-java)","Scenarios (http-js)","Scenarios (http-php)","Scenarios (http-python)","Scenarios (http-ruby-net_http-opentelemetry-instrumentation-net_http-client)","Scenarios (http-ruby-rack-opentelemetry-instrumentation-rack-server)","Test (ubuntu-latest, Python 3.14)","Test (windows-latest, Python 3.14)","Types","Zizmor Security Analysis / Zizmor Security Analysis","required-status-check","zizmor"]},"repo":"open-telemetry/semantic-conventions-conformance","repo_id":1324141285,"request_id":"25c4d7c050dd44ccb035c35e3a4864c6","schema":2,"source_private":false,"target_private":false,"workflow_ref":"review-loop-revi